  "schema:name": "National Product Catalogue (DTH PC Fig. 2, Ch. 2-3)",
  "schema:description": "Product Master Data between supply chain partners and supply chain processes (Fig. 2, PDF 11), managed in the National Product Catalogue (PDF 35) by the data management roles (PDF 26, 32, 43). The handbook does not assign processes to partners, so no line is drawn between them. Fig. 2's ordering and inventory processes map to the 0.2.0 capabilities by name only; Finance / Insurance is not drawn. Medical devices are out of the handbook's scope.",
